    "title": "Two families okay after 'hidden' fire in Raleigh housing complex - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WRAL staff ,\n13 hours ago Two families are okay following a \"hidden\" fire that broke out at a Raleigh housing complex on Wednesday night. According to the Raleigh Fire Department, the fire happened at a building on Sedgewick Drive. Firefighters told WRAL News they referred to it as a \"hidden\" fire because crews found the fire inside the walls of the complex. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
